#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10004
msgid "Generalized Ellipsoid Functions"
msgstr "广义椭球函数"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10006
msgid ""
"`Gal3D` uses nested generalized ellipsoid functions by default to fit the"
" three-dimensional morphology of galaxies. This section introduces the "
"definition of the generalized ellipsoid function and the corresponding "
"fitting method in detail."
msgstr ""
"`Gal3D` 默认使用嵌套的广义椭球函数来拟合星系的三维形态。本节将详细介绍广义椭"
"球函数的定义及其对应的拟合方法。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10008
msgid "**Classical ellipsoid**"
msgstr "**经典椭球**"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10010
msgid "The classical ellipsoid function is"
msgstr "经典椭球函数为"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10012
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\left(\\frac{x}{a}\\right)^2 + \\left(\\frac{y}{b}\\right)^2 + "
"\\left(\\frac{z}{c}\\right)^2\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10016
msgid ""
"This function describes a standard ellipsoid whose shape is determined by"
" the parameters $a$, $b$, and $c$, which represent the semi-axis lengths "
"along the $x$-, $y$-, and $z$-directions, respectively."
msgstr ""
"该函数描述了一个标准椭球，其形状由参数 $a$、$b$ 和 $c$ 决定，它们分别表示沿 "
"$x$、$y$ 和 $z$ 方向的半轴长度。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10018
msgid "**Generalized ellipsoid**"
msgstr "**广义椭球**"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10020
msgid ""
"In `Gal3D`, shape indices are introduced into the standard ellipsoid "
"function, and the generalized ellipsoid function is defined as"
msgstr ""
"在 `Gal3D` 中，标准椭球函数中引入了形状指数，并将广义椭球函数定义为"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10022
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\frac{x}{a}\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]^{S_a}\n"
"+\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\frac{y}{b}\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]^{S_b}\n"
"+\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\frac{z}{c}\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]^{S_c}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10028
msgid ""
"When $S_a = S_b = S_c = 1$, the generalized ellipsoid reduces to the "
"standard ellipsoid. The introduction of shape indices makes the ellipsoid"
" more flexible and allows it to represent more complex geometric "
"structures."
msgstr ""
"当 $S_a = S_b = S_c = 1$ 时，广义椭球就退化为标准椭球。形状指数的引入使椭球"
"具有更高的灵活性，从而能够表示更复杂的几何结构。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:10031
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"For visualizations of ellipsoids with different shape parameters, see "
"{ref}`Ellipsoids with Different Shape Parameters <ellipsoid-shape-show>`."
msgstr ""
"关于不同形状参数下椭球的可视化，可参见 {ref}`不同形状参数的椭球 "
"<ellipsoid-shape-show>`。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20002
msgid "How to Define Whether a Point Lies on the Surface"
msgstr "如何定义一个点是否位于表面上"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20004
msgid "For the generalized ellipsoid function"
msgstr "对于广义椭球函数"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20006
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"f(x,y,z) \\;=\\; \\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\frac{x}{a}\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]^{S_a}\n"
"+\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\frac{y}{b}\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]^{S_b}\n"
"+\\Bigl[\\Bigl(\\frac{z}{c}\\Bigr)^2\\Bigr]^{S_c},\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20012
msgid ""
"we define a point $(x, y, z)$ to lie on the surface when it satisfies "
"$f(x, y, z) = 1$."
msgstr ""
"我们定义当点 $(x, y, z)$ 满足 $f(x, y, z) = 1$ 时，该点位于表面上。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20014
msgid ""
"However, if we use $f(x, y, z)$ directly, its value is strongly affected "
"by the shape indices $S_a$, $S_b$, and $S_c$, and it can increase rapidly"
" with coordinate magnitude, which makes numerical calculations less "
"stable."
msgstr ""
"然而，如果直接使用 $f(x, y, z)$，其取值会强烈受到形状指数 $S_a$、$S_b$ 和 "
"$S_c$ 的影响，并且会随着坐标大小快速增长，这会使数值计算的稳定性变差。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20016
msgid ""
"Therefore, we redefine the quantity using a distance-ratio function $d(x,"
" y, z)$:"
msgstr ""
"因此，我们利用距离比函数 $d(x, y, z)$ 重新定义这一量："

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20018
msgid ""
"\n"
"d(x, y, z) = \\frac{\\sqrt{x^2 + y^2 + z^2}}{\\sqrt{x_e^2 + y_e^2 + "
"z_e^2}}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20022
msgid "where $(x_e, y_e, z_e) = k(x, y, z)$ and $f(x_e, y_e, z_e) = 1$."
msgstr "其中 $(x_e, y_e, z_e) = k(x, y, z)$，且 $f(x_e, y_e, z_e) = 1$。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20024
msgid ""
"The quantity $d(x, y, z)$ measures the ratio between the distance of the "
"point from the origin and the distance from the origin to the ellipsoidal"
" surface in the same direction. When $d(x, y, z) = 1$, the point lies on "
"the surface."
msgstr ""
"值 $d(x, y, z)$ 衡量的是该点到原点距离与同一方向上椭球表面到原点距离之间的比"
"值。当 $d(x, y, z) = 1$ 时，该点位于表面上。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:20026
msgid ""
"The examples below compare the spatial distributions of $f(x, y, z)$ and "
"$d(x, y, z)$. One can see that $d(x, y, z)$ varies more linearly for "
"different shape indices, with more evenly distributed contours, whereas "
"$f(x, y, z)$ is much more strongly affected by the exponent values."
msgstr ""
"下面的示例比较了 $f(x, y, z)$ 与 $d(x, y, z)$ 的空间分布。可以看到，对于不同"
"的形状指数，$d(x, y, z)$ 的变化更加线性，等值线分布也更均匀；而 $f(x, y, z)$"
" 则更强烈地受到指数取值的影响。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:30002
msgid "Spatial Distribution for the Standard Ellipsoid ($S_a = S_b = 1$)"
msgstr "标准椭球的空间分布（$S_a = S_b = 1$）"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:40002
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\begin{array}{r c l}\n"
"\\mathbf{Parameters} & & \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{a} & : & 3.000 \\in [0.100, \\infty] \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{eps\\_ab} & : & 0.500 \\in [0.001, 0.999] \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{eps\\_bc} & : & 0.500 \\in [0.001, 0.999] \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{sa} & : & 1.000 \\in [0.200, 2.000] \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{sb} & : & 1.000 \\in [0.200, 2.000] \\\\\n"
"\\mathrm{sc} & : & 1.000 \\in [0.200, 2.000]\n"
"\\end{array}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:60002
msgid "Variation of $f$ and $d$ along the principal axis"
msgstr "$f$ 与 $d$ 沿主轴方向的变化"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:80002
msgid "Spatial Distribution for Shape Indices $S_a = S_b = 0.2$"
msgstr "形状指数 $S_a = S_b = 0.2$ 时的空间分布"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:110002
msgid "Spatial Distribution for Shape Indices $S_a = S_b = 2$"
msgstr "形状指数 $S_a = S_b = 2$ 时的空间分布"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140002
msgid "Solving for the Point on the Ellipsoidal Surface in an Arbitrary Direction"
msgstr "求解任意方向上椭球表面上的点"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140004
msgid ""
"The key to computing $d(x, y, z)$ is to find the point $(x_e, y_e, z_e)$ "
"on the generalized ellipsoidal surface along the direction of $(x, y, "
"z)$."
msgstr ""
"计算 $d(x, y, z)$ 的关键，在于找到沿 $(x, y, z)$ 方向、位于广义椭球表面上的"
"点 $(x_e, y_e, z_e)$。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140006
msgid ""
"`Gal3D` provides several numerical iterative methods, including the "
"Newton method, Halley's method, and the Householder method, to solve for "
"this point."
msgstr ""
"`Gal3D` 提供了多种数值迭代方法来求解这一点，包括 Newton 法、Halley 法和 "
"Householder 法。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140008
msgid "**Problem definition**"
msgstr "**问题定义**"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140010
msgid ""
"Given $(x, y, z)$, the ellipsoid parameters $(a, b, c)$, and the shape "
"indices $(S_a, S_b, S_c)$, we need to solve for a scaling factor $k$ such"
" that"
msgstr ""
"给定 $(x, y, z)$、椭球参数 $(a, b, c)$ 以及形状指数 $(S_a, S_b, S_c)$，我们"
"需要求解一个缩放因子 $k$，使得"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140012
msgid "(x_e, y_e, z_e) = k(x, y, z)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140014
msgid "and the generalized ellipsoid equation is satisfied:"
msgstr "并满足广义椭球方程："

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140016
msgid ""
"\n"
"f(x_e, y_e, z_e) = 1\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140020
msgid "that is,"
msgstr "也就是说，"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140022
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"f(kx, ky, kz) = \\left(\\frac{kx}{a}\\right)^{2S_a} + "
"\\left(\\frac{ky}{b}\\right)^{2S_b} + \\left(\\frac{kz}{c}\\right)^{2S_c}"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140026
msgid "Denote this by $f(k) = f(kx, ky, kz)$."
msgstr "记其为 $f(k) = f(kx, ky, kz)$。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140028
msgid "**Numerical iterative methods**"
msgstr "**数值迭代方法**"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140034
msgid ""
"The convergence speed increases in the order Newton, Halley, and "
"Householder, but Halley and Householder require more computation per "
"iteration. In practice, the differences are usually small. Because "
"Newton's method may fail to converge in some extreme cases, `Gal3D` uses "
"Halley's method by default."
msgstr ""
"其收敛速度依次为 Newton 法、Halley 法和 Householder 法，但 Halley 法和 "
"Householder 法每次迭代需要更多计算。在实际应用中，这些差异通常较小。由于牛"
"顿法在某些极端情况下可能无法收敛，`Gal3D` 默认使用 Halley 法。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140036
msgid ""
"For the computation of the directional distance ratio $d(x, y, z)$ here, "
"the main configurable option is `config.ellipsoid_s.DistIteration`:"
msgstr ""
"对于这里方向距离比 $d(x, y, z)$ 的计算，主要的可配置选项是 "
"`config.ellipsoid_s.DistIteration`："

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140044
msgid "For numerical iteration, define the error function"
msgstr "对于数值迭代，定义误差函数"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140046
msgid ""
"\n"
"F(k) = (f(k) - 1)^2\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140050
msgid "The general form of the iteration is"
msgstr "迭代的一般形式为"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140052
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"k_{n+1} = k_n - \\Delta\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140056
msgid ""
"where $\\Delta$ is the step size. The specific expressions for different "
"methods are:"
msgstr "其中 $\\Delta$ 为步长。不同方法的具体表达式为："

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140058
msgid "Newton method:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140060
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"k_{n+1} = k_n - \\frac{F(k_n)}{F'(k_n)}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140064
msgid "Halley's method:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140066
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"k_{n+1} = k_n - \\frac{2F(k_n)F'(k_n)}{2F'(k_n)^2 + F''(k_n)F(k_n)}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140070
msgid "Householder method:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140072
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"k_{n+1} = k_n - \\frac{6F(F')^2 - 3F^2F''}{6(F')^3 - 6FF'F'' + F^2F'''}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140076
msgid "**Derivative evaluation**"
msgstr "**导数计算**"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140078
msgid ""
"The first-, second-, and third-order derivatives of the error function "
"$F(k)$ are"
msgstr ""
"误差函数 $F(k)$ 的一阶、二阶和三阶导数分别为"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140080
msgid ""
"\n"
"F'(k) = 2(f(k)-1)f'(k)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140084
msgid ""
"\n"
"F''(k) = 2(f(k)-1)f''(k) + 2f'(k)^2\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140088
msgid ""
"\n"
"F'''(k) = 2(f(k)-1)f'''(k) + 6f'(k)f''(k)\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140092
msgid "The first-, second-, and third-order derivatives of $f(k)$ are"
msgstr "$f(k)$ 的一阶、二阶和三阶导数分别为"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140094
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"f'(k) = \\frac{2S_a}{k}\\left(\\frac{xk}{a}\\right)^{2S_a} + "
"\\frac{2S_b}{k}\\left(\\frac{yk}{b}\\right)^{2S_b} + "
"\\frac{2S_c}{k}\\left(\\frac{zk}{c}\\right)^{2S_c}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140098
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"f''(k) = \\frac{2S_a(2S_a-1)}{k^2}\\left(\\frac{xk}{a}\\right)^{2S_a} + "
"\\frac{2S_b(2S_b-1)}{k^2}\\left(\\frac{yk}{b}\\right)^{2S_b} + "
"\\frac{2S_c(2S_c-1)}{k^2}\\left(\\frac{zk}{c}\\right)^{2S_c}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140102
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"f'''(k) = "
"\\frac{2S_a(2S_a-1)(2S_a-2)}{k^3}\\left(\\frac{xk}{a}\\right)^{2S_a} + "
"\\frac{2S_b(2S_b-1)(2S_b-2)}{k^3}\\left(\\frac{yk}{b}\\right)^{2S_b} + "
"\\frac{2S_c(2S_c-1)(2S_c-2)}{k^3}\\left(\\frac{zk}{c}\\right)^{2S_c}\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140106
msgid "**Adaptive step-size strategy**"
msgstr "**自适应步长策略**"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140108
msgid ""
"In addition, `Gal3D` implements an adaptive step-size strategy: at each "
"iteration, the step is multiplied by an adaptive factor $\\lambda$,"
msgstr ""
"此外，`Gal3D` 还实现了自适应步长策略：在每次迭代中，步长都会乘以一个自适应因"
"子 $\\lambda$，"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140110
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"k_{n+1} = k_n - \\lambda \\Delta\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140114
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"and $\\lambda$ is adjusted dynamically to ensure that $F(k_{n+1}) < "
"F(k_n)$, thereby improving both convergence efficiency and stability."
msgstr ""
"并动态调整 $\\lambda$，以确保 $F(k_{n+1}) < F(k_n)$，从而同时提高收敛效率和"
"稳定性。"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140117
msgid ""
"In practical fitting, one first samples $n$ points uniformly on the "
"sphere and then minimizes the error function"
msgstr ""
"在实际拟合中，首先在球面上均匀采样 $n$ 个点，然后最小化误差函数"

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140119
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\chi^2 = \\sum_{i=1}^{n} r_i^2(d(x_i, y_i, z_i)-1)^2\n"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/details/generalized_ellipsoid.ipynb:140123
msgid ""
"where the coefficient $r_i^2$ represents the approximate area weight of "
"each sampled point."
msgstr "其中系数 $r_i^2$ 表示每个采样点近似对应的面积权重。"

